<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:11:30.392 --> 00:11:39.464
<v Slow>サッカー日本代表の次の監督には、誰が就任することになりましたか。

00:11:40.264 --> 00:11:44.344
<v Host>Go Oiwa, who now coaches Japan's youth national team.

00:11:44.943 --> 00:11:52.504
