00:11:53.303 --> 00:11:56.951
<v Host>From the international friendly matches next March.

00:11:57.552 --> 00:12:05.231
<v Slow>森保監督は、いつまで日本代表の指揮を続けますか。

00:12:06.032 --> 00:12:11.144
<v Host>Until the Asian Cup, which will be held next January and February.

00:12:11.744 --> 00:12:36.464
<v Host>That's all for today. On July twenty-third, the Japan Football Association officially decided that Go Oiwa, coach of Japan's youth national team, will take over the national team from next March, on a contract through the twenty thirty World Cup. Current manager Hajime Moriyasu stays in charge until the Asian Cup early next year. Thanks for listening, and see you tomorrow.

00:12:37.063 --> 00:12:39.464
